sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Cliente
    participant P as DoctorAvailabilityController
    participant A as AvailabilityService
    participant R as DoctorAvailabilityRepositoryInterface
    participant DB as Base de datos

    C->>P: POST /api/v1/doctors/1/availability {date, startTime, endTime}
    P->>A: registerAvailability(datos)
    A->>R: hasOverlap(doctorId, date, startTime, endTime)
    R->>DB: consulta bloques existentes del médico
    DB-->>R: bloques encontrados
    R-->>A: true (existe solapamiento)
    A-->>P: lanza RuntimeException "availability_overlap"
    P-->>C: 409 Conflict {error, message}

    Note over A,R: Si no hay solapamiento, A llama a R.saveSlot(...)\ny P responde 201 Created con el bloque guardado.
